        "TileImage": "$($repository fb4b474c-c8ea-4ed1-a353-eee294cbab0e).Image",
        "Description": "Another contract has been filed in in Paris, so prepare your tuxedo, 47. Your target this time is Robin Leffler, going by the alias Angelique. She is operating as a model, but once was a high credential choir singer. Regrettably, the client has had a bad experience with the former singer, and has issued the hit. use whatever means necessary, but do us a favor and make the end quick for this person who has spread happiness to as many people as she could. Good luck, and show compassion if you can.",
